@startuml diag-flux-phase4b

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false

title Phase 4b — Détection comportementale (ML Engine vers Wazuh)

participant "Mosquitto\nBroker" as BROKER
participant "ML Engine" as ML
participant "Wazuh\nSIEM" as SIEM
participant "OpenSearch\nDashboards" as DASH

autonumber

BROKER -> ML : Souscription mTLS (lecture seule)
ML -> ML : IsolationForest + RandomForest\n→ score d'anomalie
ML -> SIEM : Envoi des scores (API REST)
SIEM -> SIEM : Corrélation IDS + ML\n→ alarme critique si double signalement
SIEM -> DASH : Restitution à l'analyste SOC

@enduml
